    {
      "text": "Appendix 1 Diagram Descriptions — Task Flow Diagrams (page 11 / printed page 10): Reference key defining the ten notation elements used in the CRDM maternal health task-flow diagrams — (1) Pools (Facility, Community), (2) Swim Lanes (Actor/Role), (3) Start Event (circle), (4) End Event (bold circle), (5) Sequence Flow (arrow), (6) Activity (rounded rectangle), (7) Subprocess (rounded rectangle with '+' marker), (8) Decision (diamond with Yes/No branches), (9) Multi-Page Connector (numbered circle), and (10) Annotation (open bracket) — accompanied by a visual Legend panel.",
